                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This dataset contains processed data supporting the publication \"Electrically Conductive 3D-Printed Piezoresistive Metastructure Lattice Sensors\". It has data related to 4-point probe measurements, Fourier-transform infrared spectroscopy, stylus-profilometry, mechanical testing, and digital multimeter measurements. The accompanying Excel worksheet is organized with all data indexed by figure numbers corresponding to the main manuscript and supplementary information."
